*: Compiles cleanly (no new symbols) Correct\n**Runtime Prediction**: Expected `{ premium: 115 }`, received `{ premium: 5 }` Correct\n**Result**: Test fails as expected.\n\n## Green -- compute premium from item base premiums + first-insurance surcharge + fee\n\nNow I need real logic: sum base premiums, add 10% first-insurance surcharge per item, add fee."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_vrtx_01WRgiZp5v25zSx8BsgTgGCf","name":"write","arguments":{"content":"const PROCESSING_FEE = 5;\n\nconst BASE_PREMIUM: Record<string, number> = {\n  sword: 100,\n  amulet: 60,\n  staff: 80,\n  potion: 40,\n};\n\nconst FIRST_INSURANCE_SURCHARGE = 0.1;\n\ninterface Item {\n  type: string;\n}\n\ninterface QuoteStep {\n  op: \"quote\";\n  items: Item[];\n}\n\ninterface Scenario {\n  customer: { yearsWithMHPCO: number };\n  steps: QuoteStep[];\n}\n\nconst quotePremium = (items: Item[]): number => {\n  const policyBase = items.reduce(\n    (sum, item) => sum + BASE_PREMIUM[item.type],\n    0,\n  );\n  const firstInsurance = policyBase * FIRST_INSURANCE_SURCHARGE;\n  return policyBase + firstInsurance + PROCESSING_FEE;\n};\n\nexport const runScenario = (scenario: Scenario): { results: unknown[] } => {\n  const results = scenario.steps.map((step) => ({\n    premium: quotePremium(step.items),\n  }));\n  return { results };\n};\n","path":"/home/experimenter/experiments/runs/2026-07-24_16-04-17_claim-office-example-mapping_v6.2-with-why-cleaned-pi_opus-4-8-no-thinking/src/claim-office.ts"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"requesty","model":"vertex/claude-opus-4-8@eu","usage":{"input":888,"output":720,"cacheRead":25171,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":0,"totalTokens":26779,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1784909167233,"responseId":"rqsty-cmpl-40560404-5884-4cfb-8874-f40b59387fd4","responseModel":"claude-opus-4-8"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_vrtx_01WRgiZp5v25zSx8BsgTgGCf","toolName":"write","content":[{"type"