 This is knowledge duplicated in two places.\n\n## Initial APP Mass (`policyBasePremium`)\n\n```\nconst components = items.filter(isComponent);\nconst mainItems = items.filter((item) => !isComponent(item));\nconst mainItemsBase = mainItems.reduce(\n  (sum, item) => sum + MAIN_ITEM_BASE_PREMIUM[item.type], 0);\nconst componentsBase = [...countByType(components).values()].reduce(\n  (sum, count) => sum + componentGroupBasePremium(count), 0);\nreturn mainItemsBase + componentsBase;\n```\n\n- Constants: `0`, `0` = 2\n- Bindings: components, mainItems, mainItemsBase, componentsBase, item(x2), sum(x2), count, MAIN_ITEM_BASE_PREMIUM, item.type, item, values-spread element ≈ 13\n- Invocations: filter(x2), isComponent(x2), reduce(x2), countByType, values, componentGroupBasePremium, `+`(inner x2 counted as invocations), MAIN_ITEM_BASE_PREMIUM[] index, spread, final `+` ≈ 14 → 28\n- Loops: 2 reduces = 10\n- Assignments: 0\n\n**Approx Total Mass: ~40** (main-item branch contributes ~15).\n\n## Refactor: replace the main-item base literal-map lookup with `itemBaseFor`\n\nThis removes the duplicated knowledge of how a main item's base is derived — `itemBaseFor` becomes the single source of truth for a single item's base."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_vrtx_01QDY4J3Ji4hybgioQJXypKP","name":"edit","arguments":{"path":"src/claim-office.ts","oldText":"  const mainItemsBase = mainItems.reduce(\n    (sum, item) => sum + MAIN_ITEM_BASE_PREMIUM[item.type],\n    0,\n  );","newText":"  const mainItemsBase = mainItems.reduce(\n    (sum, item) => sum + itemBaseFor(item),\n    0,\n  );"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"requesty","model":"vertex/claude-opus-4-8@eu","usage":{"input":4951,"output":1392,"cacheRead":10018,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":0,"totalTokens":16361,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1784909600276,"responseId":"rqsty-cmpl-8a97a31e-e30c-4b32-8dce-fdc75bd30d65","responseModel":"claude-opus-4-8"},{"r