ignment.\n- **Rule 4 (Fewest Elements)**: The mutable binding + reassignment (two assignments, mass 6 each) is the heaviest cost. Replacing with a single `const` ternary removes both.\n\n### Step 4: Implement Refactoring"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_vrtx_01GfsedFGqUFmuox8NTaEie1","name":"edit","arguments":{"path":"/home/experimenter/experiments/runs/2026-07-24_16-04-17_claim-office-example-mapping_v6.2-with-why-cleaned-pi_opus-4-8-no-thinking/src/claim-office.ts","edits":[{"oldText":"const damagePayout = (item: Item, amount: number): number => {\n  let reimbursed = amount;\n  if ((item.enchantment ?? 0) >= HIGH_ENCHANTMENT_PAYOUT_LEVEL)\n    reimbursed = amount * HIGH_ENCHANTMENT_PAYOUT_RATE;\n  return reimbursed - DEDUCTIBLE;\n};","newText":"const damagePayout = (item: Item, amount: number): number => {\n  const isHighEnchantment =\n    (item.enchantment ?? 0) >= HIGH_ENCHANTMENT_PAYOUT_LEVEL;\n  const reimbursed = isHighEnchantment\n    ? amount * HIGH_ENCHANTMENT_PAYOUT_RATE\n    : amount;\n  return reimbursed - DEDUCTIBLE;\n};"}]}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"requesty","model":"vertex/claude-opus-4-8@eu","usage":{"input":7831,"output":1611,"cacheRead":9704,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":0,"totalTokens":19146,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1784909992713,"responseId":"rqsty-cmpl-27d3c7b7-7e15-412e-8073-9c8d5beff937","responseModel":"claude-opus-4-8"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_vrtx_01GfsedFGqUFmuox8NTaEie1","toolName":"edit","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Successfully replaced 1 block(s) in /home/experimenter/experiments/runs/2026-07-24_16-04-17_claim-office-example-mapping_v6.2-with-why-cleaned-pi_opus-4-8-no-thinking/src/claim-office.ts."}],"details":{"diff":"     ...\n 144 const HIGH_ENCHANTMENT_PAYOUT_LEVEL = 8;\n 145 const HIGH_ENCHANTMENT_PAYOUT_RATE = 0.5;\n 146 \n 147 const damagePayout = (item: Item, amount: number): number => {\n-148   let reimbursed = 